WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.560
Hoshana Rabbah has a separate willow custom

00:00:02.560 --> 00:00:03.400
without a blessing.

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:05.940
Prepare suitable branches in advance.

00:00:06.220 --> 00:00:08.780
A satisfying finish can support preparation without

00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:10.380
inventing a new religious ritual.
